1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,648
Agar Windows 11 ki ye 5 shortkeys nahi jaante, to roz time hi waste kar rahe ho.

2
00:00:04,678 --> 00:00:07,044
Aur number 1 to sabse jyada useful hai.

3
00:00:07,074 --> 00:00:11,353
Number 5: jab bhi seat chhodo, to Windows + L dabao aur laptop ko turant lock karo.

4
00:00:11,383 --> 00:00:14,661
Number 4: Windows + dot. PC se emoji keyboard open hota hai.

5
00:00:14,691 --> 00:00:19,231
Number 3: browser mein galti se tab band ho gaye to bhai Ctrl + Shift + T, aur sab wapas.

6
00:00:19,261 --> 00:00:21,713
Number 2: Windows + V. Clipboard history.

7
00:00:21,743 --> 00:00:25,022
Jo bhi copy kiya, sab yahan. Pehli baar ek click se on karo.

8
00:00:25,052 --> 00:00:27,200
Aur number 1: Windows + Shift + S.

9
00:00:27,230 --> 00:00:29,727
Screen ka koi bhi hissa, screenshot le lo.

10
00:00:29,757 --> 00:00:33,905
Tumhe kaunsa pehle se pata tha? Comment karo aur subscribe karo namastetechy ko.
